// with gpgv (gunbc.runner.runner_revision_job_toolchain verify_toolchain_index).
// Every row's fields are copied from that index's stanza; Depends/Pre-Depends are verbatim. NO RELATION
// IN THIS CLOSURE HAS A '|' ALTERNATIVE, so every `alternatives` list is empty; a regenerated closure
// that meets one records the branch it took there, and the completeness check holds it to that branch. The set is closed on its own: the base
// image's dpkg database is stripped, so the base contributes nothing to the dependency proof.
// libc-bin IS A ROOT, not something the other roots pull in: nothing here depends on it, but the closure
// replaces the base's libc6, so the glibc set (libc6, libc-bin, libc-dev-bin, libc6-dev) comes from
// this one release, and libc-bin's own `libc6 (>> 2.39), libc6 (<< 2.40)` is checked against the
// closure's libc6 rather than against a base whose installed versions have no package record.

